10... Bg4 { The second most played move, but it's not very good. } 11. f3! Bf5 12. d5! Nd4 13. Kf2!! { This is simply how absurd computer chess is! This crazy prophylactic move kills all of black's intentions. } 13... Nc2 { Logical. } 14. Bb5+! Kc8 15. Bf4! Nxa1 16. Rxa1 { We're attacking and have a nice advantage! Rc1 is a big threat. } { [%csl Rc1][%cal Ra1c1] } *


