10... Ba4?? { Almost the worst move black could play! Played 14% of the time. } 11. b3! { The bishop is trapped! :) } { [%csl Ra4][%cal Rb3a4] } 11... Nxd4 12. bxa4! Nc2+ 13. Kd2 Nxa1 14. Bb5+ Kc8 15. Bb2 { The knight is trapped, Rc1 is coming, it's a disaster. } { [%csl Ra1,Rc1,Rc8,Rf8,Rg8,Rh8][%cal Rb2a1,Rh1c1,Rc1c8] } *


